    "text": "Omaha\nExamining Title Odds Ahead of College World Series in Omaha\nBy Bert Remien,\n10 hours agoOmaha, Nebraska will once again play host to the Men's College World Series beginning this weekend as one of the marquee NCAA Championships takes center stage. Eight championship-caliber programs descend upon Omaha this week, and it's time that we take a look at the odds that each team could win it all.",
